<h1>Privacy</h1>

<p>Junior Golf Wales is a directory of publicly available junior golf event
listings. Browsing the site does not require an account and we do not track
individual visitors beyond standard, anonymous web server logs.</p>

<h2>Event submissions</h2>
<p>If you submit an event using our <a href="/submit-event">submission
form</a>, we collect the event details you provide and the email address you
give us, solely so we can review and, if appropriate, publish the event.
Submitted contact details are not published or shared, and are used only for
this purpose.</p>

<h2>Cookies</h2>
<p>This site does not currently use tracking or advertising cookies.</p>

<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>Questions about this policy or your data can be sent via the
<a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>

<p class="scorecard-note">This policy will be updated if the site adds
features that collect more personal data (for example, event entry forms).</p>

